th></svg>Tip</p><p dir=\"auto\">As a maintainer, if your package is located under <code class=\"notranslate\">pkgs/by-name/*</code>, you can comment <strong><code class=\"notranslate\">@NixOS/nixpkgs-merge-bot merge</code></strong> to automatically merge this update using the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs-merge-bot\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-merge-bot</code></a>.</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add a 👍 <a href=\"https://github.blog/2016-03-10-add-reactions-to-pull-requests-issues-and-comments/\" rel=\"nofollow\">reaction</a> to <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pulls?q=is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc\">pull requests you find important</a>.</p>",
